# Apple — identity, certificates and keys

> A map of this Apple developer account: what exists, where it is, and how to work with it.
> **No secrets here.** IDs, dates and locations only — never a password, a private key,
> or the content of a `.p8` / `.p12`.
> This file lives in `$KEYS_ROOT` (`{{KEYS_ROOT}}`), outside every repo. Never move or copy it into one.
>
> **Last updated:** {{TODAY}}. Update it after every certificate renewal, new key, new
> profile or capability change — the `apple-credentials` skill does this when it makes
> the change.

