## 1. Identity

| What | Value | Note |
|---|---|---|
| **Team ID** | {{TEAM_ID}} | The team every signature, profile and app belongs to. |
| **Personal ID** | {{PERSONAL_ID}} | The person's ID inside the team. Appears **only** in the Apple Development certificate's name. **It is not a team** — choosing it as the Team fails with `No Accounts`. |
| **Apple ID** | {{ASK: the Apple ID signed in to Xcode → Settings → Accounts, and its role in the team}} | |
| **Issuer ID (App Store Connect)** | {{ISSUER_ID}} | Shared by every API key of the team. |

**Checking that a build is signed by the right team:** `codesign -dv <app> 2>&1 | grep TeamIdentifier`
must print {{TEAM_ID}}.

