## 4. Other Apple-related keys

| What | Where | Note |
|---|---|---|
| **Apple Ads API** | {{APPLEADS}} | Keyword research (`aso-keywords`). |
| **Sparkle (EdDSA)** | {{SPARKLE}} | Signs the updates of every directly-distributed Mac app. **Never generate a new one** — existing users would stop receiving updates. The public key is each app's `SUPublicEDKey`. |
