## 5. Provisioning profiles

| Where | What is there |
|---|---|
| `~/Library/Developer/Xcode/UserData/Provisioning Profiles` | Profiles Xcode manages (automatic signing). |
| `~/Library/MobileDevice/Provisioning Profiles` | Manually created store profiles. |

No profile is kept in `$KEYS_ROOT` — a profile is not a secret.

**Manual profiles found:**

{{PROFILE_TABLE}}

**Listing with expiry:**

```bash
for d in "$HOME/Library/Developer/Xcode/UserData/Provisioning Profiles" "$HOME/Library/MobileDevice/Provisioning Profiles"; do
  for f in "$d"/*; do p=$(security cms -D -i "$f" 2>/dev/null) || continue
    echo "$(/usr/libexec/PlistBuddy -c 'Print :Name' /dev/stdin <<<"$p") | $(/usr/libexec/PlistBuddy -c 'Print :ExpirationDate' /dev/stdin <<<"$p")"
  done; done
```

