## 8. Quick status

```bash
security find-identity -v                                          # certificates
ls "$KEYS_ROOT"/appstoreconnect/*/private_keys/*.p8                # API keys
defaults read com.apple.dt.Xcode IDEProvisioningTeamByIdentifier   # teams Xcode knows
```

The `apple-credentials` skill (apple-track) runs the full check:
`python3 ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/apple-credentials/scripts/apple_creds.py check`.
